{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38389","headline":"忆钓舟 · 吴融","name":"忆钓舟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青山小隐枕潺湲，一叶垂纶几泝沿。\n後浦春风随兴去，南塘秋雨有时眠。\n惯冲晓雾惊羣鴈，爱颭残阳入乱烟。\n回首无人寄惆怅，九衢尘土困扬鞭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}